{"sourceUrl":"https://ddy.cug.edu.cn/info/1040/6365.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.342721+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ddy.cug.edu.cn/info/1040/6365.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）自然资源调查研究院（地质调查研究院）（以下简称地调院）成立于</span><span>2000年5月，是我国最早成立的高校地调院之一。经过多年的建设和发展，地调院已经成为具有科技创新能力、承担国家重大地调项目、培养高水平地调人才的国内一流地调院，在基础地质、矿产资源、水文地质、工程地质和环境地质等研究领域围绕国家战略需求，结合学科前沿，开展了大量探索性研究和创新实践，取得了一系列具有国际先进水平的成果。本次活动旨在促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，帮助学生了解当前学科发展前沿热点问题。</span></span><span><span>现将我院</span>2026<span>年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案通知如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、申请对象及条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>凡有意报考我院</span></span><span><span>地质学、地质资源与地质工程、资源与环境</span></span><span><span>硕士</span></span><span><span>，以及地质学、矿物学岩石学矿床学、水文地质学、矿产普查与勘探、地质工程</span></span><span><span>博士学位研究生的各类考生均可申请。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二、</span></span><strong><span><span>时间及工作安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>学生报名：</span></span><strong><span>6<span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>—6</span><span>月</span><span>30</span><span>日（每日</span><span>8:00-17:00</span><span>）</span></span></strong><span><span>。报名学生通过学校</span><span>“</span><span>研招校园开放日报名系统</span><span>”</span><span>填报申请。</span></span><span><br/></span><span>    </span><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://epo.cug.edu.cn/Open/ZsTkssXly/Signin.aspx</span></a><span><br/></span><span>    </span><span><span>注意：</span></span><strong><span><span>未填写</span><span>“</span><span>申请院系</span><span>”</span><span>信息的，视为报名不成功</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名学生请于</span><span>6月30日前将以下材料合并成一个pdf文档扫描件打包发送邮件，打包文件名为“姓名-本科学校名称-申请专业名称”，申请材料提交邮箱：17329376@qq.com。</span></span></p><p><span><span>① </span></span><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）</span><span>2026年研招校园开放日活动申请表（报名系统导出后A4纸正反双面打印）1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>② </span></span><span><span>本人身份证和学生证原件扫描件（</span><span>PDF版）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③ 本科阶段成绩单和专业排名信息（复印件须加盖教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④ </span></span><span><span>国家大学英语四、六级考试成绩单（或其它英语等级证明等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑤其它证明材料（如已发表的论文、各类获奖证书、专家推荐信等）。</span></span></p><p><span>2. <span>校园开放日活动时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>10</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>我院审</span></span><span><span>核后，将于</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日前邮件通知符合条件的学生参加活动</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、具体活动日程</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>采用线上线下相结合的方式。外校学生采用线上形式，本校学生采用线下形式。线上参会的腾讯会议号：</span></span><span>308—580—575</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>日期</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>地点</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>内容</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7月10日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>上午</span><span>9：0</span></span><span>0-10</span><span><span>：</span><span>0</span></span><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>南望山校区地调院</span><span>3号楼2</span></span><span>11</span><span><span>会议室</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学院情况介绍、</span></span></p><p><span><span>招生政策宣讲</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7月10日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>上午</span><span>1</span></span><span>0</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>00-12</span><span><span>：</span><span>0</span></span><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>南望山校区地调院</span><span>3号楼2</span></span><span>11</span><span><span>会议室</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>导师介绍学科专业、</span></span></p><p><span><span>与学生交流互动</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>注：具体活动以现场安排为准，请关注相关通知。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1. <span>参加研招校园开放日活动的学生必须遵守中国地质大学（武汉）相关规定，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p><p><span>2. </span><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>次开放日活动仅为招生宣传，与招生选拔工作无关。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>招生单位网址：</span></span><span>https://ddy.cug.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：</span></span><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）地质调查研究院</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>赵</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>办公室电话：</span><span>027-</span></span><span>67883017</span><span><span>，</span><span>E-mail：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:17329376@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>1</span></span><span>7329376@qq.com</span></a></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>中国地质大学（武汉）</span></span></p><p><span>  <span>自然资源调查研究院（地质调查研究院）</span></span><span>     </span></p><p><span>                                                                         </span><span>2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"97142842a5ba3899f05479f9adfc2aa692d6535fb17721353316c970a2501c09","textLength":1220,"sourceSha256":"79e6e83293bf0387a278e7be376faa88b518d6da80a1418e2a45cdf8e167fff9","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0b1e9c143a654652c1b0","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）自然资源调查研究院（地质调查研究院）2026年第十二届研招校园开放日活动方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:01.342721+00:00"}
